{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.30] How we be doing it for real\n[00:03.08] So let's— let's do it for real\n[00:07.76] Yeah, for real, real-real-real\n[Chorus]\n[00:12.32] Yeah, pay my momma bills, I could do that for real\n[00:15.66] Grew up on Wayne and Eminem, yeah, I could rap for real\n[00:19.04] Thumbing through racks for real\n[00:20.12] Brrah, take a whole .30 clip, this a package deal (Uh-huh)\n[00:23.38] He say he tough as nails, but when he see the gun he melts\n[00:26.36] She like it rough as hell, may keep her to myself\n[00:29.38] Pull up on the scene, bust, they bail, we sеndin' niggas to hell\n[00:32.44] You'll never catch mе in hell, 'cause I prayed for all my wealth\n[Verse 1]\n[00:35.44] I'm off them drugs, I be gone\n[00:36.94] Like, \"What type of molly he on?\"\n[00:38.36] You and all of your homies some peons\n[00:39.84] You ain't ever on whatever we on\n[00:41.34] Sip the codeine, I'm getting my lean on\n[00:42.64] Count the bands on a daily basis\n[00:44.38] Been around the whole wide world, I done seen some places\n[00:47.38] I'm tryna forgive more, but for some niggas I still got hatred\n[00:50.34] 'Til the day I die, I'ma catch them guys and shoot them in they faces\n[00:53.42] If you wanna be close to God, then you gotta know whose Satan\n[00:56.60] All these demons that I'm slayin', niggas thinkin' that I'm playin'\n[00:59.56] While I'm singing all these songs about the demons I've been slayin'\n[01:02.48] I'm tryna get high as Michael Jackson, never-ever-land\n[01:05.52] Remember when I was almost in a casket? Won't happen again\n[01:08.98] Ride 'round with them thangs (Brrt)\n[01:10.62] Bust a nigga brain\n[Chorus]\n[01:12.16] Yeah, pay my momma bills, I could do that for real\n[01:15.66] Grew up on Wayne and Eminem, yeah, I could rap for real\n[01:19.06] Thumbing through racks for real\n[01:20.24] Brrah, take a whole .30 clip, this a package deal (Uh-huh)\n[01:23.38] He say he tough as nails, but when he see the gun he melts\n[01:26.36] She like it rough as hell, may keep her to myself\n[01:29.38] Pull up on the scene, bust, they bail, we sendin' niggas to hell\n[01:32.44] You'll never catch me in hell, 'cause I prayed for all my wealth\n[Verse 2]\n[01:35.52] I pray for all of this, that's why I'm balling\n[01:38.48] I'm feelin' like Spalding, defense and offense\n[01:41.44] I don't do no talking, load it up, spark it, off him\n[01:44.40] Got powers like Austin, bombing, marathon in Boston, hey\n[01:47.96] Money coming in like every day, checks, cash, ándale\n[01:50.96] Pockets fat, my bitch bad, she a dragon, get slayed\n[01:53.98] Cut her open, my dick stab in her stomach like a blade\n[01:57.08] Keep wide open, body bag, kill that nigga, let him hang\n[02:00.32] Taking medicine to numb the pain\n[02:02.62] Ever since they took my bros away, really I ain't have shit to say\n[02:06.42] I done moved on to finer things\n[02:08.42] The devil tryna take the rock, I been playing keep away, uh\n[Chorus]\n[02:13.06] Pay my momma bills, I could do that for real\n[02:15.66] Grew up on Wayne and Eminem, yeah, I could rap for real\n[02:19.04] Thumbing through racks for real\n[02:20.26] Brrah, take a whole .30 clip, this a package deal\n[02:23.38] He say he tough as nails, but when he see the gun he melts\n[02:26.36] She like it rough as hell, may keep her to myself\n[02:29.38] Pull up on the scene, bust, they bail, we sendin' niggas to hell\n[02:32.44] You'll never catch me in hell, 'cause I prayed for all my wealth","words":[[0.16,1.22,"[Intro]"],[1.24,1.26,"[00:01.32]"],[1.3,1.38,"How"],[1.42,1.46,"we"],[1.56,1.6,"be"],[1.7,1.92,"doing"],[1.96,2.02,"it"],[2.06,2.16,"for"],[2.22,2.44,"real"],[2.46,2.72,"[00:03.08]"],[3.08,3.12,"So"],[3.24,3.42,"let's—"],[4.14,4.34,"let's"],[4.7,4.78,"do"],[4.9,4.92,"it"],[5.04,5.2,"for"],[5.24,5.38,"real"],[5.4,6.52,"[00:04.96]"],[7.76,7.92,"Yeah,"],[7.98,8.08,"for"],[8.2,8.28,"real,"],[8.32,9.96,"real-real-real"],[11.28,11.98,"[Chorus]"],[12.0,12.22,"[00:12.34]"],[12.32,12.